note bottom of Agents
  Новый research путь: PostgreSQL mission/leases в red.
  Новых research events/outbox пока нет.
  agent-event выше относится к legacy agent-run.
end note

Integration ..> Leads : research-extraction\nsync · in-process
Leads --> Requests : research-memory / IdentityPort\nsync · in-process

legend bottom
  PL = Published Language
  C/S = Customer / Supplier
  ACL = Anticorruption Layer
  Стрелка направлена от upstream к downstream.
  Транспорт: sync · http-json — сетевые command/query;
  sync · in-process — новые typed ports при co-location;
  async · amqp — event/policy.
endlegend

